# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Vercel Deployment Ignore Rules
# Excludes heavy ML artifacts, Python backends, datasets, and virtual environments
# to keep the Next.js serverless build well under 50MB.
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

